  "steps": [
    "Mix 2 tbsp greek yogurt/hung curd, 1/2 tsp garlic powder, pinch of salt, 1 tsp honey, pinch of pepper, 1 tbsp coriander.",
    "Mix crushed 120g low fat paneer (homemade), 1 tbsp achaar(mixed/ mango pickle), 1/2 tsp salt, 1/2 tsp red chilli powder.",
    "Make a beetroot/spinach/normal wheat roti. Put it on a non-stick pan.",
    "Spread the paneer immediately onto the roti and press it down using a spatula so it sticks well to the roti.",
